      "value": "That's the only thing we got, that is somewhat closer to a full messaging system. What a disappointment honestly. Who asked for that? That is so stupid. Imagine having a very serious conversation with someone, and out of nowhere there are a lot of weird emojis popping out of you. That is insane. The most useless, idiotic and worthless feature can't be turned off? What?!",
