      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As someone who struggles with concentrating, but still tries their hardest to focus when talking with others, a distracting alert is the antithesis of what I need nor want. \n\nFor a less personal point of view: an increasing amount of studies are showing that interruptive alerts on social media cause an increase in anxiety hormones, ultimately motivating users to abandon said platforms. This function is likely going to cause the same issue and lead to less clientele.\n\nGiven these points, please include a function to turn off this new UI element.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
